{
  "pluginId": "douyu",
  "version": "3.0.1",
  "apiVersion": 1,
  "displayName": "斗鱼",
  "platformDescription": "斗鱼直播平台",
  "liveTypes": [
    "3"
  ],
  "entry": "index.js",
  "preloadScripts": [
    "lp_plugin_douyu_1.0.4_danmaku.js"
  ],
  "auth": {
    "required": false,
    "credentialKinds": [],
    "supportsStatusCheck": false,
    "supportsValidation": false
  },
  "capabilities": {
    "categories": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "rooms": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "playback": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "search": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "roomDetail": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "liveState": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "shareResolve": {
      "status": "available"
    },
    "danmaku": {
      "status": "available",
      "driver": "plugin_js_v1",
      "transport": "websocket",
      "protocolId": "douyu_ws_stt",
      "protocolVersion": "1"
    }
  },
  "changelog": [
    "manifest 规范化：platformDescription 仅描述平台定位，登录需求改由 auth.required 与 credentialKinds 明确声明",
    "登录需求明确为不需要：该插件不声明账号凭据",
    "修复斗鱼短号/靓号分享链接会把 vipId 当 roomId，导致 betard HTML 错误页被当 JSON 解析的问题",
    "弹幕连接计划显式返回 User-Agent 请求头，WebSocket 握手责任收敛到插件侧",
    "1.0.3：弹幕协议迁移到插件驱动，Douyu WebSocket 握手、心跳与 STT 文本解析改为 plugin_js_v1",
    "修复 getRoomDetail 返回 userId 始终为 0 的问题：owner_id 改为 owner_uid"
  ],
  "shareResolve": {
    "hosts": [
      "douyu.com",
      "douyu.tv"
    ]
  },
  "hostBehavior": {
    "playableLiveStates": [
      "1",
      "2"
    ],
    "externalRoomURLTemplate": "https://www.douyu.com/{roomId}",
    "themeColor": "#FF7F00"
  }
}
